  <body>
    <div id="root">
      <main class="shell landing-shell">
        <header class="masthead"><a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="SPACE home">SPACE</a></header>
        <p class="kicker">For independent catalog owners</p>
        <h1>We buy your music catalog.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">SPACE reviews revenue-generating catalogs directly across genres. Ambient, sleep, focus, meditation, wellness, lo-fi and electronic music are examples. Every catalog is assessed individually.</p>
        <p>Start with your email and artist or label name. We request the relevant income and rights documents privately by email after you apply. No upload is needed now.</p>
        <noscript><p>The review form needs JavaScript. You can instead contact <a href="mailto:hello@spacemusic.io">hello@spacemusic.io</a>. Do not send passwords or publish private documents.</p><p>Read our <a href="/pricing.md">pricing and offer policy</a> and <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</p></noscript>
      </main>
    </div>
  

</body></html>